{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"EZK","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"以西结书","commonName":"以西结书","title":"以西结书","order":26,"numberOfChapters":48,"sha256":"aa1b925988838e1371bb072e339379f03dcec5f83d41111f9f14f58e31d5e89e","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/EZK/1.json","lastChapterNumber":48,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/EZK/48.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1270},"chapter":{"number":35,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["神惩罚以东"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和华的话又临到我说："]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["「人子啊，你要面向西珥山发预言，攻击它，"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["对它说，主耶和华如此说：西珥山哪，我与你为敌，必向你伸手攻击你，使你荒凉，令人惊骇。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["我必使你的城邑变为荒场，成为凄凉。你就知道我是耶和华。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["因为你永怀仇恨，在以色列人遭灾、罪孽到了尽头的时候，将他们交与刀剑，"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["所以主耶和华说：我指着我的永生起誓，我必使你遭遇流血的报应，罪",{"noteId":36},"必追赶你；你既不恨恶杀人流血，所以这罪必追赶你。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["我必使西珥山荒凉，令人惊骇，来往经过的人我必剪除。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["我必使西珥山满有被杀的人。被刀杀的，必倒在你小山和山谷，并一切的溪水中。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["我必使你永远荒凉，使你的城邑无人居住，你的民就知道我是耶和华。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["「因为你曾说：『这二国这二邦必归于我，我必得为业』（其实耶和华仍在那里），"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["所以主耶和华说：我指着我的永生起誓，我必照你的怒气和你从仇恨中向他们所发的嫉妒待你。我审判你的时候，必将自己显明在他们中间。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["你也必知道我—耶和华听见了你的一切毁谤，就是你攻击以色列山的话，说：『这些山荒凉，是归我们吞灭的。』"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["你们也用口向我夸大，增添与我反对的话，我都听见了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["主耶和华如此说：全地欢乐的时候，我必使你荒凉。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["你怎样因以色列家的地业荒凉而喜乐，我必照你所行的待你。西珥山哪，你和以东全地必都荒凉。你们就知道我是耶和华。」"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":36,"caller":"-","text":"原文是血；本节同","reference":{"chapter":35,"verse":6}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/EZK/35.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/EZK/36.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/EZK/34.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":15}